  "body": "Discover modern family living in sought-after Half Moon Bay. This stylish, freestanding two-level home offers approximately 152m² of well-designed space on a 209m² (more or less) freehold section — perfect for families seeking comfort, convenience and excellent schooling.\r\n\r\n4 Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms | Guest Toilet | Internal-Access Garage | Freehold Title\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• Freestanding & Freehold – Two-level home with an internal-access single garage.\r\n• Spacious Layout – Four bedrooms upstairs, including a generous master with ensuite.\r\n• Modern Kitchen – Quality appliances, ample storage and a practical design.\r\n• Flexible Living – Separate dining and living areas with easy access to the outdoor space.\r\n• Sunny Outdoor Living – Deck and fully fenced, low-maintenance backyard, ideal for entertaining, children and pets.\r\n• Central Heating – Year-round comfort for the whole family.\r\n\r\nZoned for Popular Schools:\r\n• Pigeon Mountain School\r\n• Bucklands Beach Intermediate\r\n• Macleans College\r\n\r\nCoastal Lifestyle & Convenience\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Half Moon Bay, just a short drive from the marina, cafés, restaurants, shopping and ferry services to Auckland CBD. Whether you're commuting, enjoying waterfront walks or embracing the coastal lifestyle, this location delivers the perfect balance of convenience and leisure.\r\n\r\nAct Fast — Make It Yours!\r\n\r\nSecure your place in one of East Auckland's sought-after coastal suburbs. Contact us today to arrange a private viewing or visit our next open home. Don't miss this opportunity!",
